DESCRIPTION:<p>Hello All\,</p><p>This is a reminder for QA teams to complet
 e testing on the <strong>QA-1129 pod</strong> at <strong>25R3.0</strong> co
 de level. Please refer to the details below\, and additional information ca
 n be found on the <a href="https://wiki.veevadev.com/display/VQ/Qa+Release+
 Event+Testing" target="_blank">QA Release Event Testing wiki</a></p><p><str
 ong>Sign-off Jira:</strong> <a href="https://jira.veevadev.com/browse/DEV-9
 73012" target="_blank">DEV-973012</a></p><p><b><ins>QA Release Event Testin
 g Details</ins>:</b></p><ul><li><b>Production Release Version:</b> 25R3.0</
 li></ul><ul><li><b>Target Release Version:</b> 25R3.2</li></ul><ul><li><b>Q
 A Environment / Pod:</b> <a href="https://jira.veevadev.com/browse/QA-1129"
 >QA-1129</a></li></ul><ul><li><b>Testing Timeline:</b></li></ul><ul><li><ul
 ><li><b>12/04/25:</b> 9:00 AM – 1:00 PM PT</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><ul><
 li><b>12/08/25:</b> 9:00 AM – 10:00 AM PT</li></ul></li></ul><p>Please ensu
