 de level. Please refer to the details below\, and additional information ca
 n be found on the <a href="https://wiki.veevadev.com/display/VQ/Qa+Release+
 Event+Testing" target="_blank"><u><u>QA Release Event Testing wiki</u></u><
 /a></p><p><strong>Sign-off Jira: </strong><a href="https://jira.veevadev.co
 m/browse/DEV-1118569">https://jira.veevadev.com/browse/DEV-1118569</a><br><
 b><ins><br>QA Release Event Testing Details</ins>:</b></p><ul><li><b>Produc
 tion Release Version:</b> 26R1.3</li></ul><ul><li><b>Target Release Version
 :</b> 26R1.4</li></ul><ul><li><b>QA Environment / Pod:</b> <a href="https:/
 /jira.veevadev.com/browse/QA-1129" target="_blank">QA-1129</a></li></ul><ul
 ><li><b>Testing Timeline:</b></li></ul><ul><li><ul><li><b>06/12/26:</b> 9:0
 0 AM – 1:00 PM PT</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><ul><li><b>06/15/26:</b> 9:00 
 AM – 10:00 AM PT</li></ul></li></ul><p>Please ensure testing is completed w
 ithin the scheduled windows.</p><p><i>Thanks\,<br></i><i>Zafar Ahmed<br></i
 ><a href="https://wiki.veevadev.com/display/VQ/QA+Environment+Trust+Page" t
 arget="_blank">QA Trust Page</a> | Reachable on <a href="https://mattermost
 .veevadev.com/vault-products/channels/help_release_engineering" target="_bl
 ank">help-release-engineering</a></p>
