DESCRIPTION:<b>Who:</b> <br><ul><li>For all functional QA engineers and man
 agers\, primarily EDT/PDT time zone audience. Highly encouraged to attend t
 his meeting.</li><li>If your core area is automating test cases and not aut
 horing\, then this meeting will not give you much mileage.</li><li>We (QA P
 roductivity Team) will be recording and sending out the link for offline li
 stening.</li></ul><br><b>What:</b> Test authoring phase of our SDLC is gett
 ing augmented by LLMs (for now Gemini CLI only). <br><br><b>Why:</b> Given 
 a design/Impl doc of your feature / jira ID of the Epic\, leverage the powe
 r of LLM to generate TCs for you\, while you can focus better authoring the
  complex test cases. #speed is the primary goal<br><br><b>Useful Info:</b><
 br><br>If you have a <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1-OkT_
 1_PsUXX-Aj6JUpuw6IHrKAGctX2HYf5z8jWJF0/edit?usp=sharing">question before/du
 ring/after the meeting\, leave your thoughts here</a><br><br>If you have an
 y <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19b-AMuJU34aCXrDEhDXq3xLJ
 RsCl9PCo11nlh7enDYg/edit?gid=515572936#gid=515572936">feedback after the me
 eting\, capture your enhancement ideas here</a>. We will evaluate effort/va
 lue and will prioritize it for future releases<br><br>If you are trying the
  tool and found any setup issues or would like to report defects\, Automati
 on Platform &gt\; QA Productivity a DEV ticket<br><br><a href="https://docs
 .google.com/presentation/d/1IISpxFuFdw7HUI9FcR1AU8k3w0QvxN_-QP6raubyw78/edi
 t?usp=sharing">Presentation slide</a><br><br><a href="https://wiki.veevadev
 .com/spaces/QA/pages/1242006783/Test+Case+Generation+Tool">Feature rollout 
 wiki</a> <p><br>──────────<br><br>Join Zoom Meeting<br>https://veeva.zoom.u
 s/j/95777762339?pwd=v4cPEOG8wPhaSdb7IaszXtC2GaeYqM.1<br>Meeting ID: 957 777
 6 2339<br>  Password: 675760<br>Phone number :US: +1 669 900 6833<br><br>On
 e touch:  +16699006833\,\,95777762339#\,\,\,\,1#\,675760# US<br><br>Find yo
 ur local number: https://veeva.zoom.us/u/ac82LB6YIj<br><br><br>──────────</
 p>
