 n be found on the <a href="https://wiki.veevadev.com/display/VQ/Qa+Release+
 Event+Testing" target="_blank">QA Release Event Testing wiki</a></p><p><str
 ong>Sign-off Jira:</strong> <a href="https://jira.veevadev.com/browse/DEV-1
 006751" target="_blank">https://jira.veevadev.com/browse/DEV-1006751</a></p
 ><p><b><ins>QA Release Event Testing Details</ins>:</b></p><ul><li><b>Produ
 ction Release Version:</b> 25R3.4</li></ul><ul><li><b>Target Release Versio
 n:</b> 25R3.5</li></ul><ul><li><b>QA Environment / Pod:</b> QA-1129</li></u
 l><ul><li><b>Testing Timeline:</b></li></ul><ul><li><ul><li><b>02/20/25:</b
 > 9:00 AM – 1:00 PM PT</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><ul><li><b>02/23/25:</b> 
 9:00 AM – 10:00 AM PT</li></ul></li></ul><p>Please ensure testing is comple
