DESCRIPTION:<p><b>Jira/X-ray Performance Test - Group Testing </b></p><p><b
 r><b>❓ Why are we doing this?</b><br><br>In the context of X-ray enablement
 \, re-test and verify performance issues reported during 1st round of group
  testing in August 2025. Several issues were reported on these areas<br></p
 ><blockquote><ul><li>Dashboards slowness</li><li>Slow Epic Display</li><li>
 Slowness performing Bulk Update</li><li>Slow Search</li><li>Slowness Moving
  Jira issues</li></ul></blockquote><p><br>📅 Date &amp\; Time<br></p><block
 quote>Nov 24th\, 10:30AM PST / 1:30PM EST</blockquote><p><br>🔗 Useful Link
 s<br></p><blockquote><ul><li>Jira PERF Environment: jira-perf.veevadev.com<
 /li><li>Quick Guide: <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/10yk4P5xMT
 _JoxkAM0T14VMJHNcca9tpJu2Gqzp7ZMO0/edit?usp=sharing" class="pastedDriveLink
 -0">Google Doc<br></a></li><li>Log Sheet: <a href="https://docs.google.com/
 spreadsheets/d/1X4LJWPYW8ozabk2jHub1v2q_P-TEpNMrj2LdKhxj2IA/edit?usp=sharin
 g" class="pastedDriveLink-1">Google Sheet<br></a></li><li>Zoom Meeting: <a 
 href="https://veeva.zoom.us/j/96677193585?pwd=4emjJWPCZ1biwXYYlD3bAu5PbJm1O
 M.1">Join Zoom</a></li></ul></blockquote><br><br><br>📝 Instructions<blockq
 uote><br><ul><li>Log page complete load times\, time stamp and other detail
 s only when you observe slowness or a blank page.</li><li>Use your best jud
 gment based on your experience with Jira in production.</li><li>If you noti
 ce performance issues\, replicate the action in the production environment 
 for comparison.</li><li>If production performs significantly faster\, log t
 he response time accordingly.</li></ul></blockquote><p><br>──────────<br><b
 r>Join Zoom Meeting<br><a href="https://veeva.zoom.us/j/96677193585?pwd=4em
 jJWPCZ1biwXYYlD3bAu5PbJm1OM.1" target="_blank">https://veeva.zoom.us/j/9667
