DESCRIPTION:Details will be posted to the <a href="https://www.google.com/u
 rl?q=https://veeva.veevashare.com/025dc7432ff4401000/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source
 =calendar&amp\;ust=1788692027084182&amp\;usg=AOvVaw31pV7ax9CZtplRSKNIUrqh" 
 target="_blank"><u><u>EKO Share Page</u></u></a> as they are finalized.<br>
 <ul><li><b>EKO <b>Hyderabad </b>   </b>- September 2nd &amp\; 3rd\, 2026</l
 i></ul><br><b>What is Engineering Kickoff?</b><br><br>EKO is a two-day even
 t bringing together our Veeva Engineering teams to learn\, connect\, and sh
 are insights gained over the past year—both the successes and the lessons l
 earned. It’s also a time to celebrate all we’ve accomplished and look ahead
  to what’s next. <br><br>We&#39\;ll have team-building and social events\, 
 keynote speakers\, peer-led sessions\, and conversations with senior leader
 ship. This is our chance to strengthen relationships\, grow our technical a
 nd cultural knowledge\, and keep our momentum going into the next year!<br>
 <br>We&#39\;re looking forward to seeing all of you. you can find more deta
 ils about sessions in <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://share.v
 eevashare.com/0367eb1cb88d801000/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1
 788692027084182&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1UrCSX62MOkhEJJc302Ogp" target="_blank">Hyde
 rabad EKO Share page</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260901T105404Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Virtual Event: Hyderabad Engineering Kickoff 2026
TRANSP:OPAQUE
