  discuss anything related to the Automation Platform. My Zoom would be on f
 or this entire duration. Please feel free to join at any time and feel free
  to decline if you do not have anything to discuss on any particular day.\n
 \nIf you think any conversation will take longer than 10 minutes\, please s
 et up the meeting invite during this time slot with the required attendees.
  This will assist others in organizing their discussions appropriately.\n\n
