DESCRIPTION:Topic: Application Advocacy: Optimizing the Developer Experienc
 e \nDescription: There’s a new team on Vault: The Application Advocacy team
 !\n\nOur mission is to enable applications to build on the platform faster 
 and more effectively by providing world class documentation\, responsive 1-
 on-1 support\, and strong advocacy for application needs within the platfor
 m. In this application-focused session\, we’ll demo several of our tools an
 d share how we’re working to improve the end-to-end developer experience. W
 e’ll also leave plenty of time for questions\, feedback\, and discussion\; 
 so come ready to share what’s working (and what’s not).\n\nJoin from PC\, M
 ac\, iPad\, or Android:\n<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://veev
 a.zoom.us/s/91704224099?pwd%3DgL0HHkZKgVvUoIpSjIuRsr4Cb9tSsw.1&amp\;sa=D&am
 p\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1788692254379741&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2Ho1-M-zqcqjeE4
 MrtXV9f" target="_blank">https://veeva.zoom.us/s/91704224099?pwd=gL0HHkZKgV
 vUoIpSjIuRsr4Cb9tSsw.1</a>\nPasscode:204334
