DESCRIPTION:<p>Hello All\,</p><p>This is a reminder for QA teams to complet
 e testing on the <strong>QA-8 pod</strong> at <strong>26R1.0</strong> code 
 level. Please refer to the details below\, and additional information can b
 e found on the <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://wiki.veevadev.
 com/display/VQ/Qa%2BRelease%2BEvent%2BTesting&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calenda
 r&amp\;ust=1782672211500840&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2zf2idGg_SIF-gz2DEiu2O" target="
 _blank"><u><u>QA Release Event Testing wiki</u></u></a></p><p><b><ins>QA Re
 lease Event Testing Details</ins>:</b></p><ul><li><b>Production Release Ver
 sion:</b> 26R1.0</li></ul><ul><li><b>Target Release Version:</b> 26R2.0</li
 ></ul><ul><li><b>QA Environment / Pod:</b> <a href="https://www.google.com/
 url?q=https://jira.veevadev.com/browse/QA-8&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&
 amp\;ust=1782672211500840&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1XD4ksP28AkEYIS6mirlkA" target="_b
 lank"><del>QA-8</del></a></li></ul><ul><li><b>Testing Timeline:</b></li></u
 l><ul><li><ul><li><b>07/2/26:</b> 9:00 AM – 1:00 PM PT</li></ul></li></ul><
 ul><li><ul><li><b>07/3/26:</b> 9:00 AM – 10:00 AM PT</li></ul></li></ul><p>
 Please ensure testing is completed within the scheduled windows.</p><p><i>T
 hanks\,<br></i><i>Zafar Ahmed<br></i><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=
 https://wiki.veevadev.com/display/VQ/QA%2BEnvironment%2BTrust%2BPage&amp\;s
 a=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1782672211500840&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3Jab6GuxE
 Wri5yp1x4RFcY" target="_blank">QA Trust Page</a> | Reachable on <a href="ht
 tps://www.google.com/url?q=https://mattermost.veevadev.com/vault-products/c
 hannels/help_release_engineering&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=17
 82672211500840&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2AagHhgo2PmNvizyhN44ct" target="_blank">help-
 release-engineering</a></p>
