 e testing on the <strong>QA-1129 pod</strong> at <strong>25R3.0</strong> co
 de level. Please refer to the details below\, and additional information ca
 n be found on the <a href="https://wiki.veevadev.com/display/VQ/Qa+Release+
 Event+Testing" target="_blank"><u>QA Release Event Testing wiki</u></a></p>
 <p><strong>Sign-off Jira: </strong><a href="https://jira.veevadev.com/brows
 e/DEV-1036812">https://jira.veevadev.com/browse/DEV-1036812</a></p><p><b><i
 ns>QA Release Event Testing Details</ins>:</b></p><ul><li><b>Production Rel
 ease Version:</b> 26R1.0</li></ul><ul><li><b>Target Release Version:</b> 26
 R1.2</li></ul><ul><li><b>QA Environment / Pod:</b> <a href="https://jira.ve
 evadev.com/browse/QA-1129" target="_blank">QA-1129</a></li></ul><ul><li><b>
 Testing Timeline:</b></li></ul><ul><li><ul><li><b>04/16/26:</b> 9:00 AM – 1
 :00 PM PT</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><ul><li><b>04/17/26:</b> 9:00 AM – 10:
 00 AM PT</li></ul></li></ul><p>Please ensure testing is completed within th
 e scheduled windows.</p><p><i>Thanks\,<br></i><i>Zafar Ahmed<br></i><a href
 ="https://wiki.veevadev.com/display/VQ/QA+Environment+Trust+Page" target="_
 blank">QA Trust Page</a> | Reachable on <a href="https://mattermost.veevade
 v.com/vault-products/channels/help_release_engineering" target="_blank">hel
 p-release-engineering</a></p>
