DESCRIPTION:<p>Hello All\,</p><p>This is a reminder for QA teams to complet
 e testing on the <strong>QA-8 pod</strong> at <strong>25R3.0</strong> code 
 level. Please refer to the details below\, and additional information can b
 e found on the <a href="https://wiki.veevadev.com/display/VQ/Qa+Release+Eve
 nt+Testing" target="_blank">QA Release Event Testing wiki</a></p><p><strong
 >Sign-off Jira:</strong> <a href="https://jira.veevadev.com/browse/DEV-1018
 988">https://jira.veevadev.com/browse/DEV-1018988</a></p><p><b><ins>QA Rele
 ase Event Testing Details</ins>:</b></p><ul><li><p><a href="https://docs.go
 ogle.com/spreadsheets/d/1_z7ZkrCwqPSd_zqx7UOkRzHRP1ABVsvFZXbI5Rl-Ars/edit?g
 id=1902808025#gid=1902808025" target="_blank"><strong><ins></ins></strong><
 /a><strong><a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1FrcLSndfo00J95L
 YnfeRRgp_XCAySD1gLGz1T-UywKY/edit?gid=1699097366#gid=1699097366">Release Da
 shboard</a></strong></p><p><strong><ins>QA Release Event Testing Details</i
 ns>:</strong></p></li><li><strong>Production Release Version:</strong> 25R3
 .0<ul></ul></li><li><strong>Target Release Version:</strong> 26R1.0<ul></ul
 ></li><li><strong>QA Environment / Pod:</strong> <a href="https://jira.veev
 adev.com/browse/QA-1129">QA-8</a></li><li><strong>Testing Timeline:</strong
 ><ul><li><ul><li><strong>03/11/26:</strong> 9:00 AM – 1:00 PM PT</li></ul><
 /li></ul><ul><li><ul><li><strong>03/12/26:</strong> 9:00 AM – 10:00 AM PT</
 li></ul></li></ul></li><p><br /></p></ul><p>Please ensure testing is comple
 ted within the scheduled windows.</p><p><i>Thanks\,<br /></i><i>Zafar Ahmed
 <br /></i><a href="https://wiki.veevadev.com/display/VQ/QA+Environment+Trus
 t+Page" target="_blank">QA Trust Page</a> | Reachable on <a href="https://m
 attermost.veevadev.com/vault-products/channels/help_release_engineering" ta
 rget="_blank">help-release-engineering</a></p>
