 g>25R2.0</strong> code level. Please refer to the details below\, and addit
 ional information can be found on the <a href="https://wiki.veevadev.com/di
 splay/VQ/Qa+Release+Event+Testing" target="_blank">QA Release Event Testing
  wiki</a></p><p><strong>Sign-off Jira:</strong> <a href="https://jira.veeva
 dev.com/browse/DEV-945059" target="_blank">DEV-945059</a></p><p><strong>QA 
 Release Event Testing Details:</strong></p><ul><li><b>Production Release Ve
 rsion:</b> 25R2.0</li></ul><ul><li><b>Target Release Version:</b> 25R3.0</l
 i></ul><ul><li><b>QA Environment / Pod: </b>QA-8</li></ul><ul><li><b>Testin
 g Timeline:</b><ul><li><b>10/22/25:</b> 9:00 AM – 1:00 PM PT</li><li><b>10/
 23/25:</b> 9:00 AM – 10:00 AM PT</li></ul></li></ul><p>Please ensure testin
 g is completed within the scheduled windows</p><p><i>Thanks\,</i></p><br><i
 >Zafar Ahmed</i><br><a href="https://wiki.veevadev.com/display/VQ/QA+Enviro
 nment+Trust+Page" target="_blank">QA Trust Page</a> | Reachable on <a href=
 "https://mattermost.veevadev.com/vault-products/channels/help_release_engin
 eering" target="_blank">help-release-engineering</a>
