 sg=AOvVaw1j3cQvff8CIU0OU4NiAwlA" target="_blank">DEV-945059</a></p><p><stro
 ng>QA Release Event Testing Details:</strong></p><ul><li><b>Production Rele
 ase Version:</b> 25R2.0</li></ul><ul><li><b>Target Release Version:</b> 25R
 3.0</li></ul><ul><li><b>QA Environment / Pod: </b>QA-8</li></ul><ul><li><b>
