DESCRIPTION:<p>Moving RET as deployment start was delayed due to delay in 3
 .2 branch cut.<br><br>Hello All\,</p><p>This is a reminder for QA teams to 
 complete testing on the <strong>QA-1129 pod</strong> at <strong>25R3.0</str
 ong> code level. Please refer to the details below\, and additional informa
 tion can be found on the <a href="https://wiki.veevadev.com/display/VQ/Qa+R
 elease+Event+Testing" target="_blank">QA Release Event Testing wiki</a></p>
 <p><strong>Sign-off Jira:</strong> <a href="https://jira.veevadev.com/brows
 e/DEV-973012" target="_blank">DEV-973012</a></p><p><b><ins>QA Release Event
  Testing Details</ins>:</b></p><ul><li><b>Production Release Version:</b> 2
 5R3.0</li></ul><ul><li><b>Target Release Version:</b> 25R3.2</li></ul><ul><
 li><b>QA Environment / Pod:</b> <a href="https://jira.veevadev.com/browse/Q
 A-1129" target="_blank">QA-1129</a></li></ul><ul><li><b>Testing Timeline:</
 b></li></ul><ul><li><ul><li><b>12/04/25:</b> 9:00 AM – 1:00 PM PT</li></ul>
 </li></ul><ul><li><ul><li><b>12/08/25:</b> 9:00 AM – 10:00 AM PT</li></ul><
 /li></ul><p>Please ensure testing is completed within the scheduled windows
 .</p><p><i>Thanks\,<br></i><i>Zafar Ahmed<br></i><a href="https://wiki.veev
 adev.com/display/VQ/QA+Environment+Trust+Page" target="_blank">QA Trust Pag
 e</a> | Reachable on <a href="https://mattermost.veevadev.com/vault-product
 s/channels/help_release_engineering" target="_blank">help-release-engineeri
 ng</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251213T051009Z
