ORGANIZER;CN=Danny Chan:mailto:danny.chan@veeva.com
UID:7ff5la8ul3tbc2jjv2g4s47ti7@google.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;CN=sa
 tyavinay.vella@veeva.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:satyavinay.vella@veeva.com
CREATED:20251014T144206Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Hi\,<br><br>This is a calendar reminder for planned maintena
 nce.<strong><br><br>Who:</strong> All Automation Platform Tools users<br><s
 trong>When:</strong> <strong>Saturday\, October 18\, 2025</strong>\, from <
 strong>7:00 AM to 1:00 PM PT</strong> (approximately 6 hours)<br><strong>Wh
 at:</strong> The Automation Platform Tools will be <strong>temporarily unav
 ailable</strong> due to scheduled maintenance.</p><p><strong>Impact:</stron
 g></p><ul><li><p><strong>Test Result Processing Delays:</strong> Log shippi
 ng to OpenSearch\, updates to the Triage sheet\, and Automation Failure Tra
 cker (AFT) processing will be <strong>paused</strong> during maintenance an
 d <strong>resume once completed</strong>.</p></li><li><p><strong>Tools Acce
 ss Unavailable:</strong> Automation Platform Tools site<b>(</b><a href="htt
 ps://autoinfra.vaultdev.com/" target="_blank">https://autoinfra.<wbr />vaul
 tdev.com/</a>) and Tools Services may be <strong>intermittently unavailable
 </strong> throughout the maintenance window.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Why:</
 strong><br>We are upgrading the Automation Platform Tools PostgreSQL databa
 se to <strong>version 17</strong> to enhance <strong>performance</strong> a
 nd <strong>reduce operational costs</strong>.</p><p>Please plan your work a
 ccordingly and avoid scheduling any automation activities during this time.
 </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251021T042723Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Planned Maintenance: Automation Platform Tools Database Upgrade
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
